message: "If you cite this computational research thesis, please use the metadata below. No DOI is minted here; do not invent one."
type: thesis
title: "Host infection windows that re-rank immunometabolic hypothesis structures without entering Θ"
authors:
  - family-names: Ogbonna
    given-names: Kelechi Emeka
    email: kelechiogbonna300@gmail.com
    alias: cloudynirvana
abstract: >-
  Can declared infection/host delay windows change the rank order of
  immunometabolic hypothesis structures while both the windows and the
  immunometabolic non-parameters stay outside Θ? Five declared structure
  records share a frozen kinetic vector of length 7. The ranker does not read
  it. With an immunometabolic ledger alone the joint key places the
  checkpoint-scaled record first. Attaching an infection window and a
  marrow-stress-like window places the windowed checkpoint record first.
  A key that ignores the windows does not move first place. A window-only
  sort that drops the lactate-band mask would promote an inadmissible record;
  the joint key does not. A proposal that writes ledger constants and
  window-derived keys into Θ is refused, and the SHA-256 digest of Θ is
  unchanged. Depends on Thesis #10 and Thesis #14. Not a dose. Not a medical device.
keywords:
  - immunometabolism
  - hypothesis rank
  - host infection window
  - lactate
  - checkpoint proxy
  - non-parameter
  - refuse-as-parameter
  - toy model
  - research-only
